# Chromium style, which most of the code already follows; one-line ifs
# without else stay on one line, as the code writes them. tool/format.sh
# applies it to changed lines only. Standard: Latest, or Objective-C
# generics get C++03's "> >".
---
BasedOnStyle: Chromium
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: WithoutElse
Standard: Latest
